l lumps  and bumps i'll just take my pin and just  pin it into place just so you can kind  of really tidy up the edges and then see  any little fly away hairs like this i  like to then use the star on steroids  texturizing spray just to help give me a  bit more volume and hold i don't think  you need hairspray on this because it  should be light and airy and have that  really voluminous finish  i can't wait to try that  [Music]  you

